    "class Decoder(nn.Module):\n",
    "    def __init__(self, n_features, hidden_dim):\n",
    "        super().__init__()\n",
    "        self.hidden_dim = hidden_dim\n",
    "        self.n_features = n_features\n",
    "        self.hidden = None\n",
    "        self.basic_rnn = nn.GRU(self.n_features, self.hidden_dim, batch_first=True)\n",
    "        self.regression = nn.Linear(self.hidden_dim, self.n_features)\n",
    "\n",
    "    def init_hidden(self, hidden_seq):\n",
    "        # We only need the final hidden state\n",
    "        hidden_final = hidden_seq[:, -1:]  # N, 1, H\n",
    "        # But we need to make it sequence-first\n",
    "        self.hidden = hidden_final.permute(1, 0, 2)  # 1, N, H\n",
    "\n",
    "    def forward(self, X):\n",
    "        # X is N, 1, F\n",
    "        batch_first_output, self.hidden = self.basic_rnn(X, self.hidden)\n",
    "\n",
    "        last_output = batch_first_output[:, -1:]\n",
    "        out = self.regression(last_output)\n",
    "\n",
    "        # N, 1, F\n",
    "        return out.view(-1, 1, self.n_features)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "329f079f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- 由于初始隐藏状态必须来自编码器，因此我们需要一种方法来初始化隐藏状态并设置对应的属性。不过编码器的输出是**批次优先（batch-first）**格式，而隐藏状态必须始终为**序列优先（sequence-first）**格式，所以我们要置换它的前两个维度。\n",
    "- 隐藏状态属性既是循环层的输入，也是循环层的输出。\n",
    "- 输出的形状必须与输入的形状保持一致，即长度为1的序列。\n",
    "- 在循环生成目标序列的过程中，`forward()`方法会被多次调用。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "da13453d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "decoder = Decoder(n_features=2, hidden_dim=4)\n",
    "# Initial hidden state will be encoder's final hidden state\n",
    "decoder.init_hidden(hidden_seq)\n",
    "# Initial data point is the last element of source sequence\n",
    "inputs = source_seq[:, -1:]\n",
    "target_len = 2\n",
    "for i in range(target_len):\n",
    "    print(f\"Hidden: {decoder.hidden}\")\n",
    "    out = decoder(inputs)  # Predicts coordinates\n",
    "    print(f\"Output: {out}\\n\")\n",
    "    # Predicted coordinates are next step's inputs\n",
    "    inputs = out"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7e3664cc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Problem\n",
    "不过上述方法存在一个问题：未经训练的模型会产生非常糟糕的预测结果，而这些预测结果仍会被用作后续步骤的输入。这会无端增加模型训练的难度，因为某一步的预测误差既来源于（未训练的）模型本身，也来自上一步产生的预测误差。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "78919ecc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Teaching Force\n",
    "原理很简单：不使用模型的预测结果，而是改用目标序列中的真实数据。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 测试阶段，模型只能使用自身在前序步骤中生成的预测结果，没有其他选择。\n",
    "问题在于，采用教师强制训练的模型，会基于目标序列每一步的正确输入来最小化损失。然而在测试阶段，这种理想情况永远不会出现，因此当模型将自身的预测结果作为输入时，性能往往会变差。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5c38ec4a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "心存疑虑时，不妨抛硬币，字面意义上的抛硬币。在训练过程中，模型有时会采用教师强制策略，有时则会使用自身的预测结果。因此我们会偶尔向模型提供真实输入来辅助它，但同时仍要求模型具备足够的鲁棒性，能够生成并使用自身的输入。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "8c79d88f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Initial hidden state will be encoder's final hidden state\n",
    "decoder.init_hidden(hidden_seq)\n",
    "# Initial data point is the last element of source sequence\n",
    "inputs = source_seq[:, -1:]\n",
    "teacher_forcing_prob = 0.5\n",
    "target_len = 2\n",
    "for i in range(target_len):\n",
    "    print(f\"Hidden: {decoder.hidden}\")\n",
    "    out = decoder(inputs)\n",
    "    print(f\"Output: {out}\\n\")\n",
    "    # If it is teacher forcing\n",
